# SSO — mounted at /sso on the shared caddy listener (127.0.0.1:8080).
#
# Add this line to the `route { ... }` block of the http://:8080 server in
# /etc/caddy/Caddyfile, next to the other `import prefix ...` lines:
#
#     import prefix sso 127.0.0.1:3550
#
# It reuses the existing (prefix) snippet, which forwards both `/sso` and
# `/sso/*` after stripping the prefix. That matches the application: FastCGI sees
# plain paths (/oauth/token, /admin), while SSO_ISSUER carries the public /sso
# base URL in every issued token and in the discovery document.
#
# No extra stanza is needed: caddy already forwards X-Forwarded-For/-Proto, and
# the app trusts them only from 127.0.0.1 (SSO_TRUSTED_PROXIES).
